{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":485503,"name":"Diaz Brown","username":"Diazb123","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/d/d2c977/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-09-07T14:59:51.040Z","cooked":"\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-485503-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-485503-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eWhere does the bug appear (feature/product)?\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-485503-describe-the-bug-2\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-485503-describe-the-bug-2\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDescribe the Bug\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSubject: Grok Bot — All Bots Failing on Mac \u0026amp; iOS\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot is currently unusable for our account. Our primary Bot and other Bots are returning “Bot failed to respond”, including on both macOS and iOS.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBefore this, the Mac desktop was also unable to load conversations while iOS still worked. We have already tried restarting the app, Retry, a separate iPhone hotspot, and confirming Privacy Mode.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBecause similar reports appear to involve a stuck shared Agent Computer, could you please check our Agent Computer/backend state and manually recover or reattach it if necessary?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePlease do not reset or replace our Agent Computer without our approval. We have significant Bot configurations, files, routines, credentials, and workflows that we need to preserve.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-485503-steps-to-reproduce-3\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-485503-steps-to-reproduce-3\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eSteps to Reproduce\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIssue is ongoing - failing to respond\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-485503-operating-system-4\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-485503-operating-system-4\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eOperating System\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMacOS\u003cbr\u003e\niOS\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-485503-version-information-5\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-485503-version-information-5\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eVersion Information\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFor grok bot\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-485503-does-this-stop-you-from-using-cursor-6\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-485503-does-this-stop-you-from-using-cursor-6\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDoes this stop you from using Cursor\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNo - Cursor works, but with this issue\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":1,"post_type":1,"posts_count":10,"updated_at":"2026-09-07T15:07:40.263Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":19,"reads":18,"readers_count":17,"score":113.6,"yours":false,"topic_id":170915,"topic_slug":"chief-agent-grok-bot-failing-to-respond","display_username":"Diaz Brown","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":2,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[{"id":2,"count":1}],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":136640,"hidden":false,"trust_level":0,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/chief-agent-grok-bot-failing-to-respond/170915/1","reactions":[{"id":"+1","type":"emoji","count":1}],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":1,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null,"can_vote":false},{"id":485623,"name":"Dean Rie","username":"deanrie","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/deanrie/{size}/1263_2.png","created_at":"2026-09-07T17:13:20.455Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eHey, thanks for the detailed report. Main point first: this isn’t anything on your Mac, iPhone, or network. Some Grok Bot Agent Computers, including yours, currently have an issue on our side where every message fails with “Bot failed to respond” on all devices, even though the Agent Computer is still visible. We’re tracking it. The earlier situation where Mac wouldn’t load conversations but iOS worked was a separate issue and it’s already fixed.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFor now, please don’t click Reset or Update, don’t log out, and don’t reinstall the app. Your bots, files, routines, credentials, and workflows on the Agent Computer are safe, and we want to keep them that way. The recovery is handled on our side and your data will be preserved. I’ve added your account to the recovery list, so you don’t need to do anything.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOnce it’s restored, just close and reopen the Grok Bot app and resend your last message.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":5,"post_type":1,"posts_count":10,"updated_at":"2026-09-07T17:13:20.455Z","reply_count":1,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":1,"reads":18,"readers_count":17,"score":13.6,"yours":false,"topic_id":170915,"topic_slug":"chief-agent-grok-bot-failing-to-respond","display_username":"Dean Rie","primary_group_name":"CursorStaff","flair_name":"CursorStaff","flair_url":"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/a/d/ad08adc640929ae1e98be69dab1ad0844cee99a0.png","flair_bg_color":"","flair_color":"","flair_group_id":42,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":"","bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":true,"admin":true,"staff":true,"user_id":750,"hidden":false,"trust_level":4,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_his